WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.111 --> 00:00:03.211
PART OF A SCHEDULED ROTATION IN

00:00:03.212 --> 00:00:03.778
LESS THAN TWO MONTHS.

00:00:03.779 --> 00:00:08.516
NEW AT THIS HOUR, APPROVED

00:00:08.517 --> 00:00:11.052
HOMELAND SECURITY DEPARTMENT

00:00:11.053 --> 00:00:12.887
REQUEST FOR MORE PERSONNEL AT

00:00:12.888 --> 00:00:14.522
THE SOUTHERN BORDER.

00:00:14.523 --> 00:00:15.456
MEANWHILE, PRESIDENT TRUMP IS

00:00:15.457 --> 00:00:16.958
ABOUT TO MAKE ANOTHER MAJOR

00:00:16.959 --> 00:00:18.993
PROPOSAL FOR WHAT CONTINUES TO

00:00:18.994 --> 00:00:21.829
BE HIS REELECTION CAMPAIGN.

00:00:21.830 --> 00:00:23.898
IT INVOLVES A NEW WAY OF

00:00:23.899 --> 00:00:25.433
DECIDING WHO GETS IN AND WHO

00:00:25.434 --> 00:00:25.933
DOES NOT.

00:00:25.934 --> 00:00:27.602
CHIEF WHITE HOUSE CORRESPONDENT

00:00:27.603 --> 00:00:30.672
JOHN ROBERTS HAS MORE FROM THE

00:00:30.673 --> 00:00:31.272
WHITE HOUSE NORTH LAWN.

00:00:31.273 --> 00:00:34.475
&gt;&gt; IN ADDITION TO HIS SIGNATURE

00:00:34.476 --> 00:00:37.111
ISSUE OF ELIMINATING ILLEGAL

00:00:37.112 --> 00:00:38.646
IMMIGRATION, HE IS PROPOSING

00:00:38.647 --> 00:00:39.380
MAJOR REFORMS TO LEGAL

00:00:39.381 --> 00:00:40.048
IMMIGRATION.

00:00:40.049 --> 00:00:41.182
SO FAR, THOSE PROPOSALS HAVE

00:00:41.183 --> 00:00:43.651
BEEN MET WITH AS MUCH OPPOSITION

00:00:43.652 --> 00:00:44.552
AS HIS PLANS TO DEAL WITH

00:00:44.553 --> 00:00:48.289
ILLEGAL IMMIGRANTS.

00:00:48.290 --> 00:00:50.158
&gt;&gt; WHITE HOUSE STAFF ARE

00:00:50.159 --> 00:00:52.660
EXPECTED TO DELIVER A PLAN FOR

00:00:52.661 --> 00:00:53.628
MERIT-BASED EMIGRATION.

00:00:53.629 --> 00:00:55.563
PRESIDENT TRUMP INSISTING THAT

00:00:55.564 --> 00:00:56.130
THE CURRENT SYSTEM IS

00:00:56.131 --> 00:00:57.131
IRREPARABLY BROKEN PEWS BECAUSE

00:00:57.132 --> 00:00:58.666
THE PROBLEM IS YOU HAVE TEN

00:00:58.667 --> 00:01:00.301
TIMES MORE PEOPLE COMING UP WITH

00:01:00.302 --> 00:01:02.270
THEIR FAMILIES.

00:01:02.271 --> 00:01:03.037
IT'S LIKE DISNEYLAND.

00:01:03.038 --> 00:01:05.373
&gt;&gt; THE PRESIDENT HAS PROMOTED

00:01:05.374 --> 00:01:06.741
MERIT BASED IMMIGRATION, SIMILAR

00:01:06.742 --> 00:01:08.609
TO CANADA, AUSTRALIA, AND

00:01:08.610 --> 00:01:09.010
NEW ZEALAND.

00:01:09.011 --> 00:01:11.546
HE ALSO WANTS TO ELIMINATE THE

00:01:11.547 --> 00:01:13.314
VISA LOTTERY AND A CHAIN

00:01:13.315 --> 00:01:13.681
MIGRATION.

00:01:13.682 --> 00:01:14.449
DEMOCRATS HAVE FIERCELY OPPOSED

00:01:14.450 --> 00:01:16.718
TO THE PRESENT, BUT THE

00:01:16.719 --> 00:01:18.353
WHITE HOUSE HOPES THAT MAYBE

00:01:18.354 --> 00:01:18.720
CHANGING.

00:01:18.721 --> 00:01:20.254
&gt;&gt; WE HAVE A NUMBER OF ALMOND

00:01:20.255 --> 00:01:23.024
COMPANY CHILDREN SKYROCKETING.

00:01:23.025 --> 00:01:23.758
THE NUMBER OF THOSE INDIVIDUALS

00:01:23.759 --> 00:01:26.961
COMING ACROSS OUR BORDER, BEING

00:01:26.962 --> 00:01:28.296
SMUGGLED AND TAKEN ADVANTAGE IS

00:01:28.297 --> 00:01:30.164
HERE TO EXPLOIT IT.

00:01:30.165 --> 00:01:30.665
NOW MEMBERS OF THE

00:01:30.666 --> 00:01:32.667
DEMOCRATIC PARTY HOPEFULLY ARE

00:01:32.668 --> 00:01:34.001
SEEING EXACTLY WHAT THE

00:01:34.002 --> 00:01:35.002
PRESIDENT HAS BEEN TALKING

00:01:35.003 --> 00:01:36.904
ABOUT, AND WE WILL HAVE A NEW

00:01:36.905 --> 00:01:38.673
WILLINGNESS TO HELP US ADDRESS

00:01:38.674 --> 00:01:40.641
APPEARS &gt;&gt; NANCY PELOSI,

00:01:40.642 --> 00:01:41.275
SENATOR CHUCK SCHUMER, AND

00:01:41.276 --> 00:01:42.310
OTHERS WILL BE AT THE

00:01:42.311 --> 00:01:42.977
WHITE HOUSE TOMORROW FOR THE

00:01:42.978 --> 00:01:44.212
FIRST TIME SINCE JANUARY 9TH

00:01:44.213 --> 00:01:47.181
WHEN PRESIDENT TRUMP WALKED OUT

00:01:47.182 --> 00:01:48.316
OF THEIR MEETING ON WALL

00:01:48.317 --> 00:01:48.649
FUNDING.

00:01:48.650 --> 00:01:51.052
INFRASTRUCTURE IS THE MAIN

00:01:51.053 --> 00:01:52.220
TOPIC, BUT IMMIGRATION, NO

00:01:52.221 --> 00:01:54.455
DOUBT, WILL COME OF YOUR CUSTOMS

00:01:54.456 --> 00:01:55.690
AND BORDER PROTECTION IS

00:01:55.691 --> 00:01:56.858
PREPARING FOR A MASSIVE INFLUX

00:01:56.859 --> 00:01:59.227
OF PEOPLE NOW THAT WORD HAS GONE

00:01:59.228 --> 00:02:01.629
OUT THAT ATTENTION SETTERS ARE

00:02:01.630 --> 00:02:04.732
FULL, AND PEOPLE ARE BEING

00:02:04.733 --> 00:02:06.601
RELEASED INTO THE U.S.

00:02:06.602 --> 00:02:09.003
&gt;&gt; YOU WILL BE ALLOWED TO STAY.

00:02:09.004 --> 00:02:11.472
YOU WILL BE RELEASED BECAUSE OUR

00:02:11.473 --> 00:02:13.708
COURT SYSTEM IS SO BACKLOGGED.

00:02:13.709 --> 00:02:15.109
EVEN IF THERE IS NO RIGHT TO

00:02:15.110 --> 00:02:15.576
STAY IN THE U.S.

00:02:15.577 --> 00:02:18.713
&gt;&gt; TITLING STOMACH TACKLING A

00:02:18.714 --> 00:02:21.682
NEW PROBLEM, THEY ARE SENDING

00:02:21.683 --> 00:02:24.652
EXPERTS AND HUMAN SMUGGLING TO

00:02:24.653 --> 00:02:26.154
THE BORDER.

00:02:26.155 --> 00:02:28.890
MIGRANTS POSES CHILDREN TO

00:02:28.891 --> 00:02:30.958
CREATE A FAKE FAMILY TO EXPLOIT

00:02:30.959 --> 00:02:31.492
AN IMMIGRATION.

00:02:31.493 --> 00:02:36.931
THEY ARE FORGING DOCUMENTS TO

00:02:36.932 --> 00:02:38.433
PRESENT THEMSELVES AS MINORS

00:02:38.434 --> 00:02:40.268
WHEN THEY ARE ACTUALLY 18.

00:02:40.269 --> 00:02:42.437
ON ANOTHER FIGHT WITH CONGRESS.

00:02:42.438 --> 00:02:44.439
THIS TIME OVER ATTORNEY GENERAL

00:02:44.440 --> 00:02:45.072
WILLIAM BARR'S THURSDAY

00:02:45.073 --> 00:02:45.740
APPEARANCE BEFORE THE HOUSE

00:02:45.741 --> 00:02:48.576
JUDICIARY COMMITTEE.

00:02:48.577 --> 00:02:49.243
JERROLD NADLER WANT STAFF

00:02:49.244 --> 00:02:51.846
ATTORNEYS TO QUESTION HIM ABOUT

00:02:51.847 --> 00:02:53.181
THE MUELLER REPORT AFTER MEMBERS

00:02:53.182 --> 00:02:55.049
OF CONGRESS HAD HAD THEIR TURN.

00:02:55.050 --> 00:02:56.884
&gt;&gt; THERE ARE VALID REASONS TO

00:02:56.885 --> 00:02:59.854
WANTING TO BE ABLE TO HAVE

00:02:59.855 --> 00:03:00.521
COUNSEL ASKING QUESTIONS.

00:03:00.522 --> 00:03:03.424
WE HAVE SEEN MANY NUMBERS OF

00:03:03.425 --> 00:03:05.827
INSTANCES WHERE A WITNESS

00:03:05.828 --> 00:03:08.830
FILIBUSTER FOR FOUR AND A HALF,

00:03:08.831 --> 00:03:11.199
GIVE A BAD ANSWER, NOT

00:03:11.200 --> 00:03:11.566
FOLLOW-UP.

00:03:11.567 --> 00:03:14.469
IT'S BECAUSE I FIRED BACK "NOT

00:03:14.470 --> 00:03:14.969
GOING TO HAPPEN."

00:03:14.970 --> 00:03:18.406
THE ATTORNEY GENERAL AGREED TO

00:03:18.407 --> 00:03:20.408
APPEAR BEFORE CONGRESS.

00:03:20.409 --> 00:03:21.142
THEREFORE, MEMBERS OF CONGRESS

00:03:21.143 --> 00:03:22.610
SHOULD BE THE ONES DURING THE

00:03:22.611 --> 00:03:23.044
QUESTIONING.

00:03:23.045 --> 00:03:24.679
THEY REMIT HAPPY TO ENGAGE WITH

00:03:24.680 --> 00:03:27.515
MEMBERS ON THEIR QUESTIONS,

00:03:27.516 --> 00:03:28.316
REGARDING THE MUELLER REPORT.

00:03:28.317 --> 00:03:29.951
&gt;&gt; LATE THIS AFTERNOON, ROD

00:03:29.952 --> 00:03:30.618
ROSENSTEIN ANNOUNCED THAT HE

00:03:30.619 --> 00:03:34.255
WILL BE LEAVING THE DEPARTMENT

00:03:34.256 --> 00:03:35.056
EFFECTIVE MAY 11TH.

00:03:35.057 --> 00:03:36.491
BACK IN JANUARY, ROSENSTEIN SAID

00:03:36.492 --> 00:03:38.893
THAT HE WOULD BE RESIGNING AFTER

00:03:38.894 --> 00:03:40.661
THE MUELLER REPORT WAS RELEASED.

00:03:40.662 --> 00:03:43.064
IN HIS RESIGNATION LETTER TODAY,

00:03:43.065 --> 00:03:43.698
ROSENSTEIN SAID THAT THE

00:03:43.699 --> 00:03:46.434
DEPARTMENT MADE RAPID PROGRESS

00:03:46.435 --> 00:03:46.901
IN ACHIEVING THE

00:03:46.902 --> 00:03:48.436
ADMINISTRATION'S LAW ENFORCEMENT

00:03:48.437 --> 00:03:50.605
PRIORITIES.

00:03:50.606 --> 00:03:51.305
ATTORNEY GENERAL BARR PRAISED

00:03:51.306 --> 00:03:52.874
THEM, SAYING HE HAS BEEN AN

00:03:52.875 --> 00:03:54.775
INVALUABLE PARTNER TO ME DURING

00:03:54.776 --> 00:03:56.611
MY RETURN TO THE DEPARTMENT,

00:03:56.612 --> 00:03:58.714
THAT I HAVE RELIED HEAVILY ON

